  "pages": [
    {
      "id": "1001",
      "title": "Engineering Handbook",
      "parentId": null,
      "depth": 0,
      "bit": 1,
      "html": "<p>Everything a new engineer needs, in one place. Start with <a href=\"index.html#page-1002\">Onboarding</a>, then read the <a href=\"index.html#page-1004\">Architecture overview</a>.</p><h2>Owners</h2><p>Maintained by @Priya Shah and @Sam Lee. Questions go to the <code>#eng-help</code> channel.</p><blockquote><p>This handbook is the source of truth. If something here is wrong, fix it.</p></blockquote>"
    },
    {
      "id": "1002",
      "title": "Onboarding",
      "parentId": "1001",
      "depth": 1,
      "bit": 2,
      "html": "<p>Your first two weeks, step by step. Day-by-day details are in <a href=\"index.html#page-1003\">First week</a>.</p><h2>Before day one</h2><ul><li>[x] Laptop ordered</li><li>[x] Accounts requested</li><li>[ ] Buddy assigned: @Sam Lee</li></ul><h2>Who to ask</h2><table><tr><th><p>Topic</p></th><th><p>Contact</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>Access and accounts</p></td><td><p>@Priya Shah</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>Code review</p></td><td><p>@Sam Lee</p></td></tr></table>"
    },
    {
      "id": "1003",
      "title": "First week",
      "parentId": "1002",
      "depth": 2,
      "bit": 4,
      "html": "<ul><li><p>Day 1: set up your machine</p></li><li><p>Day 2: ship a small fix, tracked in <a href=\"https://example.atlassian.net/browse/ENG-42\">ENG-42</a></p></li><li><p>Day 3 to 5: pair on the current sprint</p></li></ul><h2>Set up your machine</h2><pre><code>git clone git@example.com:acme/app.git&#10;cd app&#10;npm ci&#10;npm test</code></pre><p><strong>Troubleshooting</strong></p><p>If tests fail on a fresh clone, check your Node version against <code>.nvmrc</code>.</p>"
    },
    {
      "id": "1004",
      "title": "Architecture overview",
      "parentId": "1001",
      "depth": 1,
      "bit": 8,
      "html": "<p>Three services, one direction of traffic.</p><p><img src=\"media/system-overview.svg\" alt=\"System overview\"></p><h2>Services</h2><table><tr><th><p>Service</p></th><th><p>Owner</p></th><th><p>Status</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>Web app</p></td><td><p>@Sam Lee</p></td><td><p>[LIVE]</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>API</p></td><td><p>@Priya Shah</p></td><td><p>[MIGRATING]</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"3\"><p>For access, read <a href=\"index.html#page-1002\">Onboarding</a>. The database is managed by the platform team.</p></td></tr></table><blockquote><p>Never connect to the production database from a laptop.</p></blockquote>"
    },
    {
      "id": "1005",
      "title": "Release checklist",
      "parentId": "1001",
      "depth": 1,
      "bit": 16,
      "html": "<p>Next release: 2026-10-20 [IN PROGRESS]</p><ul><li>[x] Changelog written</li><li>[ ] Staging sign-off by @Priya Shah</li><li>[ ] Announce in <code>#releases</code></li></ul><ul><li><strong>Decision:</strong> Releases ship on Tuesdays, never Fridays.</li></ul><h2>Open release issues</h2><p>The live issue list is a Confluence macro. Its omission is recorded as a warning in the export.</p><!-- macro: jira jql=\"project = ENG AND resolution = Unresolved\" -->"
    }
  ],
